        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our Business Payments segment provides payment processing solutions (including accounts payable automation, debit and credit card processing, virtual credit card processing, ACH processing and other electronic payment acceptance solutions) that enable our clients to collect or send payments to other businesses.",
